# Implementation plan — Spec 1.9.1

## Summary

Spec 1.9.1 replaces link-based password reset with a **4-digit OTP** (1-minute expiry) sent by the Email microservice, and clarifies **History** / **Templates** admin scoping for super admin vs company admin. See [01-overview.md](./01-overview.md) through [03-email-history-templates.md](./03-email-history-templates.md).

## Branch and prerequisites

| Item | Value |
|------|--------|
| Branch | `spec/1.9.1` |
| Depends on | Merged **1.9.0** Email service + Identity Email integration |
| Ports | Identity FE :3001 BE :4001; Email FE :3004 BE :4004 |

---

## Phase 1 — Email template and scope

**Goal:** `password_reset_otp` seed; API scope for History/Templates.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Seed migration | `email/backend/migrations/*_password_reset_otp_template.ts` |
| History controller scope | `email/backend/src/**/history*` |
| Templates controller scope | `email/backend/src/**/template*` |
| Editor placeholder help | `email/frontend/src/features/templates/**` |

**Exit:** Super admin edits OTP template; scoped history API verified.

---

## Phase 2 — Identity OTP backend

**Goal:** OTP lifecycle + Email trigger.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| OTP migration | `identity/backend/migrations/` |
| Auth service | `identity/backend/src/services/auth.service.ts` (or dedicated otp service) |
| Routes/controllers | `identity/backend/src/controllers/auth.controller.ts`, routes |
| Email client | Reuse existing internal send client from 1.9.0 |

**Exit:** Three APIs work via curl/Postman.

---

## Phase 3 — Identity OTP frontend

**Goal:** Three-step UI.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Verify OTP page | `identity/frontend/src/features/auth/pages/VerifyResetOtpPage.tsx` |
| Forms | `ForgotPasswordForm`, `ResetPasswordForm` |
| Router | `identity/frontend/src/app/App.tsx` |
| API client | `identity/frontend/src/features/auth/services/authApi.ts` |

**Exit:** Full browser reset flow.

